    "directions": [
      "Peel the potatoes and grate the potatoes with big holed side of the grater.",
      "Heat oil in a pan. Add green peas and saute for a minute.",
      "Add grated potatoes, poha and season with salt and mix well.",
      "Add all the powdered spices and mix well. Mash everything and turn off the flame.",
      "Let the mixture cool a bit. Divide the mixture and make patties according to the size of the bun.",
      "Cover with foil or cling film and freeze for an hour.",
      "For batter combine refined flour, corn flour, salt and mix. Add sufficient water and make a thick batter.",
      "Take the patties out of the freezer. Dip them batter and coat with bread crumbs.",
      "Repeat with all the patties.",
      "Now heat oil for frying (can deep fry or shallow fry). Fry the patties on medium flame till nice golden brown in colour.",
      "Now for assembling, cut through the burger buns horizontally.",
      "On one half of the bun, apply mayonnaise. Place some onion and tomato.",
      "Now place the patty and close with other half of the bun."
    ],
